t and a voice bellows: â€œYouâ€™re having the time of your lives, remember!â€</p><p>The voice belongs to the director <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/film/2015/mar/05/still-alice-director-wash-westmoreland-religious-cult-making-porn-celebrating-julianne-moore-oscar">Wash Westmoreland</a>; the very real house â€“ situated next to the noisy A308 â€“ stands on the grounds of Bray Studios in Berkshire. As for the&nbsp;partygoers, well â€¦ theyâ€™re some&nbsp;of the most famous young faces on the planet.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/jul/10/kit-connor-joe-locke-interview-heartstoppers-forever-queer-teen-drama-netflix">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;LPIMAvowL7w5BqhhH19vRGQevSwEcZRiQtXggRmT4Ksƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;pwutwonZ-9Y-1GqCT3XE1hxfW-ja6tfMXeJeK-ID2vkƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ntg15v2_RyBp1W9NvHG77b6THfVQ8Ua3oi6q1fjkPxcƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;MsWlYb4zDKtJ3BBrYOC6iN49Ve6GOAP1391TpZg8sZ8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;mYxciayQ_xyZc_iaIltDLyNE0P-cWI4lxFuSGMMYMggƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;PYefckm0xav2pRilpeLV4812WylhPjyJu_zYMczjOawƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;naVLYX7xI_e_WcdUq8m3HT9JQTv4ASY18Xok3LfdKwsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;OSPgg0kjuxYbXdlj9m2gVd8AFeVyxK8t4WNcKBDySgkƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerig